  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Know Your Rigths</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DSU and YSG are applying for a pilot project titled &#x201C;Know your rights&#x201D;. This project will focus on engaging urban youth in the fight for better labour rights in Georgia while also raising awareness on the existing rights and how to ensure that these are respected. This will be done through production of informational material for social media, that will be used to recruit participants for five workshops and a three-day summer camp covering labour rights and organisational training.</narrative>
  </description>
